  "name": {
    "ja": "MG 1/100 ガンダムベース限定 ガンダムナドレ",
    "en": "MG 1/100 Gundam Base Limited Gundam Nadre"
  },
  "price": {
    "amount": 5500,
    "currency": "JPY",
    "taxIncluded": true,
    "taxRate": 10
  },
  "releaseDate": {
    "ja": "2023年10月07日 (土)",
    "year": 2023,
    "month": 10,
    "day": 7
  },
  "targetAge": 15,
  "scale": "1/100",
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "全世界のガンプラファンにむけた、公式ガンプラ総合施設「ガンダムベース」の限定ガンプラです。",
      "en": "A limited edition Gunpla at the official Gunpla facility \"Gundam Base\" for Gunpla fans around the world."
    },
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士ガンダム 00』より、MG 1/100 ガンダムナドレが一部新規造形で登場！",
      "en": "From \"Mobile Suit Gundam 00\", MG 1/100 Gundam Nadre appears with some new modeling!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 新規造形の特徴的な頭部コードは多層構造により表情や密度感を精密に再現。",
      "en": "• The characteristic head cord of the new model has a multi-layer structure that accurately reproduces the expression and sense of density."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 専用のシールド、GNビームライフル、エフェクトが付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with a special Seal, GN Beam Rifle, and effects."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• プラモデルオリジナルのガンダムナドレ専用のマーキングシールが付属。",
      "en": "• Includes MarkingSeal exclusive to Gundam Nadre, an original plastic model."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• GNドライヴのほか、ボーナスパーツとして太陽炉も付属。",
      "en": "• In addition to the GN Drive, a solar furnace is also included as a bonus part."
    }
  ],
